# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.pyc
MrRSS
mrrss
MrRSS.exe
mrrss.exe
mrrss-test
mrrss-test.exe
test-build
test-build.exe
mrrss-server
mrrss-server.exe
nul

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
coverage
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
.idea/
.vscode/

# Wails
build/bin/
build/dmg/
build/appimage/
build/skills/
build/appimagetool-x86_64.AppImage
dist/
wailsjs/wailsjs/runtime/
frontend/bindings/

# database files
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
data/

# vue & vite
node_modules/
dist/
package.json.md5
*.syso
unused-files.json

# Cypress
frontend/cypress/videos/
frontend/cypress/screenshots/
frontend/cypress/downloads/

# log
*.log

# taskfile cache
.task/cache/
.task/checksum

# Claude
.claude/
.plan/
tmpclaude-*-cwd

# Tools
i18n_usage_report.md
__pycache__/
.VSCodeCounter

# Android build outputs
build/android/app/build/
build/android/build/
build/android/.gradle/
build/android/gen/
build/android/overlay.json
build/android/local.properties
build/android/app/src/main/jniLibs/

# Frontend build stash left by an interrupted Vite build
frontend/dist.bak/

# Local debugging captures and agent scratch state
# (emulator screenshots, CDP probe scripts, session notes)
.tmp-emu/
.workbuddy-ai/
.qoder/
.codex/

# OS and editor metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.iml
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
# Verification scaffolding: probe scripts, fixture servers, screenshots and run
# results are produced by hand against a live emulator or browser. The acceptance
# ledger (docs/MOBILE_FOLO_ACCEPTANCE.zh.md) records what they showed; the artifacts
# themselves stay local.
docs/evidence/